 \graphicspath{{../Figures/94-AppendixC/}{figs/94-AppendixC/}}
 
-This appendix documents the numeric geometry and compliance parameters behind the force and torque models of Chapters~\ref{ch:muscles} and~\ref{ch:torque} as they exist in the project's MATLAB code, with file names given so that any value can be traced to the code that produced it. Route and bracket coordinates are coded in meters and reported here in millimeters; stiffnesses are coded and reported in newtons per meter. The bracket reference points are interpretation choices for the 3D-printed (Onyx FDM) attachment hardware, set from CAD by the author; moving a reference point changes the identified stiffness values, so the points are recorded here alongside the values they produced.
